  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Energy Technology Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EnergyNET project is a collaboration between African universities on education and research in the area of Energy Technology. The aim is to jointly increase the quality of educational programs and the research capacities needed to address the technical, socio-economic and environmental challenges related to the transition towards clean and sustainable energy solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
